{"ratings":[{"id":"F1","consequence":"diag","trigger":"plausible","reason":"Coordinator jobs can record a different load source than the one injected into the engine, but the figure is diagnostic and is not used by the classifier."},{"id":"F2","consequence":"secret","trigger":"unusual","reason":"A failing remote gate persists a registered credential without redaction when the worker identity contains it."},{"id":"F3","consequence":"test","trigger":"plausible","reason":"The test cannot distinguish a signature taken from the failed attempt from one taken from the passing retry, although the current production recorder uses the failed attempt."}]}